# Vercel deploy path

When the user asks to commit, upload, or deploy to Vercel:

1. Author commits as `tapiwaguduza <tapiwaguduza@gmail.com>` (Hobby blocks `j@local`).
2. Push the branch, then **merge into `main` and push `main`**. Production (`nissangtrauto.co.zw`) auto-deploys from `main` only.
3. Do not stop at a feature-branch preview unless they ask for preview-only.
4. Vercel hosts `apps/web` only. Still merge the branch to `main` so Git + production stay in sync.
